WEBVTT

00:02:58.341 --> 00:03:01.661
Butler alivutiwa pia na kufwatilia
tena historia.

00:03:01.661 --> 00:03:03.771
Mfano
"Jamaa" inaelezea hadithi ya

00:03:03.771 --> 00:03:06.171
mwanamke anayerudishwa nyuma
ya muda mara kwa mara

00:03:06.171 --> 00:03:09.241
kwenye shamba la Maryland la mababu zake.

00:03:09.241 --> 00:03:13.771
Mwanzoni, anagundua kwamba kazi yake
ni kuokoa maisha ya mwananume mweupe

00:03:13.771 --> 00:03:15.532
ambae atambaka nyanya yake.

00:03:15.532 --> 00:03:19.662
Asipomuokoa, yeye mweyewe
atasitishwa kuwepo

00:03:19.664 --> 00:03:23.074
Haya matatizo makali yanamlazimisha Dana
kutazama majanga yanayoendelea

00:03:23.074 --> 00:03:26.684
ya utumwa na ubakaji yanayowakabili
wanawake Weusi.

00:03:26.684 --> 00:03:29.334
Na simulizi zake za wanawake
kuanzisha jumuiya mpya,

00:03:29.334 --> 00:03:31.864
wasafiri wa mda wakishinda
fitina za kihistoria,